          <p><strong>4. Evidence of planning.</strong> Research, a plan, and notes on how it was made.</p>
          <p><strong>5. Explainable.</strong> We have to be able to explain every part out loud.</p>
        `
      },
      work: {
        title: "Work",
        html: `
